<title>UK: Norway's Troll crude to load 7.2 mln bbls in Jun.</title>
<headline>Norway's Troll crude to load 7.2 mln bbls in Jun.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norways' Troll oil field is scheduled to load 7.2 million barrels of crude oil in June compared to 8.2 million in May, traders said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The June programme consists of five cargoes of 400,000 barrels, six cargoes of 600,000 barrels and one each of 700,000 and 900,000 barrels, traders said.</p>
<p>--London newsroom, +44 171 542 4984</p>
